WEBVTT

00:02:28.276 --> 00:02:30.516
that's the only region that matters.

00:02:30.556 --> 00:02:32.196
And that really frustrates people,

00:02:32.236 --> 00:02:34.116
and it's really bad economics.

00:02:34.556 --> 00:02:37.956
For too long, we've ignored
agriculture and manufacturing,

00:02:37.956 --> 00:02:41.676
two of the most important
sectors for the environment,

00:02:41.716 --> 00:02:45.676
that need to pioneer new ways
of producing goods and food sustainably.

00:02:47.076 --> 00:02:49.796
Being an economist,

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:53.596
I know that UK productivity has stalled

00:02:53.596 --> 00:02:55.716
and the average weekly wage
has not recovered

00:02:55.756 --> 00:02:57.156
since the financial crisis.

00:02:57.476 --> 00:02:59.396
That's a decade of lower pay.

00:02:59.436 --> 00:03:00.956
And that really hurts.